            <h2 class="headS">Who I am</h2>
            <p>
                I'm a design leader with a background in cognitive science. I build
                and lead design teams, and I design products that align with how
                people actually behave.
                <br /><br />
                I have a strong foundation in user research and human factors, and
                I've established design practice inside agile product organisations.
                My industry experience spans automotive, fintech, and music — most
                recently as Head of Product Design at Helvo.
                <br /><br />
                On this site I write about design leadership, the tools I build for
                my own craft, and how design connects to customer experience and
                brand.
            </p>

